              </media>
           </para>
          <para id="para-00026">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to
            compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00007">
          <para id="para-00027">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00028">Your answer may vary, but here is a sample.</para>
              <media alt="A number line is shown with an open circle on a point in the middle. The number is shaded to the left of the open circle.">
              <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_11_09_04.jpg"/>
            </media>
          
        </solution>
